---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.EnrollSolutionProjectsRequest
---@field solution? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaEnrollSolutionRequestSolutionEnum|string Required. Solution to enroll.
---@field project string Required. Full resource name of parent. Format: `projects/{project_number_or_id}`

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.ExportAnalyticsMetricsProjectsLocationsCatalogsRequest
---@field outputConfig? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaOutputConfig Required. The output location of the data. Only `bigquery_destination` is supported, and `bigquery_destination.table_type` must be set to `view`.
---@field filter? string A filtering expression to specify restrictions on returned metrics. The expression is a sequence of terms. Each term applies a restriction to the returned metrics. Use this expression to restrict results to a specific time range. Currently we expect only one types of fields: * `timestamp`: This can be specified twice, once with a less than operator and once with a greater than operator. The `timestamp` restriction should result in one, contiguous, valid, `timestamp` range. Some examples of valid filters expressions: * Example 1: `timestamp > "2012-04-23T18:25:43.511Z" timestamp < "2012-04-23T18:30:43.511Z"` * Example 2: `timestamp > "2012-04-23T18:25:43.511Z"`
---@field catalog string Required. Full resource name of the parent catalog. Expected format: `projects/*/locations/*/catalogs/*`

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.ExportProjectsLocationsCatalogsBranchesProductsRequest
---@field outputConfig? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaOutputConfig Required. The output location of the data. Only `bigquery_destination` is supported, and `bigquery_destination.table_type` must be set to `view`.
---@field filter? string Deprecated: This field is deprecated. Any filter provided will be ignored.
---@field parent string Required. Resource name of a Branch, and `default_branch` for branch_id component is supported. For example `projects/1234/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog/branches/default_branch`

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.ExportProjectsLocationsCatalogsUserEventsRequest
---@field outputConfig? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaOutputConfig Required. The output location of the data. Only `bigquery_destination` is supported, and `bigquery_destination.table_type` must be set to `view`.
---@field filter? string Deprecated: This field is deprecated. Any filter provided will be ignored.
---@field parent string Required. Resource name of a Catalog. For example `projects/1234/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog`

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetAlertConfigProjectsRequest
---@field name string Required. Full AlertConfig resource name. Format: projects/{project_number}/alertConfig

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetAttributesConfigProjectsLocationsCatalogsRequest
---@field name string Required. Full AttributesConfig resource name. Format: `projects/{project_number}/locations/{location_id}/catalogs/{catalog_id}/attributesConfig`

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetCompletionConfigProjectsLocationsCatalogsRequest
---@field name string Required. Full CompletionConfig resource name. Format: `projects/{project_number}/locations/{location_id}/catalogs/{catalog_id}/completionConfig`

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetConversationalSearchCustomizationConfigProjectsLocationsCatalogsRequest
---@field name string Required. Resource name of the parent catalog. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/catalogs/{catalog}

