---@field catalog string The parent catalog resource name, such as `projects/*/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog`.

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetGenerativeQuestionFeatureProjectsLocationsCatalogsRequest
---@field catalog string Required. Resource name of the parent catalog. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/catalogs/{catalog}

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetLoggingConfigProjectsRequest
---@field name string Required. Full LoggingConfig resource name. Format: projects/{project_number}/loggingConfig

