---@field name string The name of the operation resource.

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetProjectsLocationsCatalogsBranchesPlacesOperationsRequest
---@field name string The name of the operation resource.

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetProjectsLocationsCatalogsBranchesProductsRequest
---@field name string Required. Full resource name of Product, such as `projects/*/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog/branches/default_branch/products/some_product_id`. If the caller does not have permission to access the Product, regardless of whether or not it exists, a PERMISSION_DENIED error is returned. If the requested Product does not exist, a NOT_FOUND error is returned.

---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetProjectsLocationsCatalogsBranchesRequest
---@field name string Required. The name of the branch to retrieve. Format: `projects/*/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog/branches/some_branch_id`. "default_branch" can be used as a special branch_id, it returns the default branch that has been set for the catalog.
---@field view? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GetProjectsLocationsCatalogsBranchesViewEnum|string The view to apply to the returned Branch. Defaults to [Branch.BranchView.BASIC] if unspecified. See documentation of fields of Branch to find what fields are excluded from BASIC view.

