---Represents a link between a Merchant Center account and a branch. After a link is established, products from the linked Merchant Center account are streamed to the linked branch.
---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLink
---@field feedLabel? string The FeedLabel used to perform filtering. Note: this replaces [region_id](https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/reference/rest/v2.1/products#Product.FIELDS.feed_label). Example value: `US`. Example value: `FeedLabel1`.
---@field feedFilters? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLinkMerchantCenterFeedFilterList Criteria for the Merchant Center feeds to be ingested via the link. All offers will be ingested if the list is empty. Otherwise the offers will be ingested from selected feeds.
---@field merchantCenterAccountId? string Required. The linked [Merchant center account id](https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/guides/accountstatuses). The account must be a standalone account or a sub-account of a MCA.
---@field languageCode? string Language of the title/description and other string attributes. Use language tags defined by [BCP 47](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/bcp/bcp47.txt). ISO 639-1. This specifies the language of offers in Merchant Center that will be accepted. If empty, no language filtering will be performed. Example value: `en`.
---@field branchId? string Required. The branch ID (e.g. 0/1/2) within the catalog that products from merchant_center_account_id are streamed to. When updating this field, an empty value will use the currently configured default branch. However, changing the default branch later on won't change the linked branch here. A single branch ID can only have one linked Merchant Center account ID.
---@field id? string Output only. Immutable. MerchantCenterAccountLink identifier, which is the final component of name. This field is auto generated and follows the convention: `BranchId_MerchantCenterAccountId`. `projects/*/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog/merchantCenterAccountLinks/id_1`.
---@field source? string Optional. An optional arbitrary string that could be used as a tag for tracking link source.
---@field name? string Output only. Immutable. Full resource name of the Merchant Center Account Link, such as `projects/*/locations/global/catalogs/default_catalog/merchantCenterAccountLinks/merchant_center_account_link`.
---@field projectId? string Output only. Google Cloud project ID.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLinkStateEnum Output only. Represents the state of the link.

---@alias gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLinkList gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLink[]

---Merchant Center Feed filter criterion.
---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLinkMerchantCenterFeedFilter
---@field dataSourceId? string AFM data source ID.
---@field primaryFeedId? string Merchant Center primary feed ID. Deprecated: use data_source_id instead.
---@field primaryFeedName? string Merchant Center primary feed name. The name is used for the display purposes only.

---@alias gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLinkMerchantCenterFeedFilterList gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaMerchantCenterAccountLinkMerchantCenterFeedFilter[]

