---@field productDetails? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaProductDetailList Optional. The product details associated with the panel.
---@field attributionToken? string Optional. The attribution token of the panel.
---@field panelPosition? number Optional. The ordered position of the panel, if shown to the user with other panels. If set, then total_panels must also be set.
---@field displayName? string Optional. The display name of the panel.
---@field totalPanels? number Optional. The total number of panels, including this one, shown to the user. Must be set if panel_position is set.

---@alias gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaPanelInfoList gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaPanelInfo[]

