---Metadata for pinning to be returned in the response. This is used for distinguishing between applied vs dropped pins.
---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaPinControlMetadata
---@field allMatchedPins? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaPinControlMetadataProductPinsMap Map of all matched pins, keyed by pin position.
---@field droppedPins? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaPinControlMetadataProductPinsMap Map of pins that were dropped due to overlap with other matching pins, keyed by pin position.

---List of product ids which have associated pins.
