---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchRequestPersonalizationSpec
---@field mode? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchRequestPersonalizationSpecModeEnum|string Defaults to Mode.AUTO.

---@alias gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchRequestPersonalizationSpecModeEnum "MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"AUTO"|"DISABLED"

