---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchResponseConversationalSearchResultSuggestedAnswer
---@field productAttributeValue? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaProductAttributeValue Product attribute value, including an attribute key and an attribute value. Other types can be added here in the future.

---@alias gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchResponseConversationalSearchResultSuggestedAnswerList gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchResponseConversationalSearchResultSuggestedAnswer[]

---A facet result.
---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchResponseFacet
---@field values? gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchResponseFacetFacetValueList The facet values for this field.
---@field key? string The key for this facet. E.g., "colorFamilies" or "price" or "attributes.attr1".
---@field dynamicFacet? boolean Whether the facet is dynamically generated.

---A facet value which contains value names and their count.
---@class gcp.unstable.retail_v2alpha.GoogleCloudRetailV2alphaSearchResponseFacetFacetValue
